&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="15"&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L'INCLUSION ET DE L'ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16"&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l'immense valeur qu'apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c'est pourquoi l'Inclusion est l'un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es. Decathlon s'engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d'aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n'affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="18"&gt;🇬🇧 English Version&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="19"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Our Instore team is looking for an Android Tech Lead (f/m/d) — Software Engineer IC3 on a permanent contract based in Villeneuve-d'Ascq.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20"&gt;The Instore team develops mobile applications for in-store sales advisors. The &lt;strong data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="79"&gt;Cube In Store&lt;/strong&gt; application enables over 60,000 teammates across 60+ countries to manage shelf displays, customer relations, and order placements efficiently. Your mission will be to integrate new solutions to manage and prepare in-store business operations within an agile and driven team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="21"&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="22"&gt;As an &lt;strong data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="6"&gt;Android Tech Lead (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive the technical execution within the feature team and act as a bridge between product and engineering:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="23"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Coaching&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead, mentor, and grow the technical team (developers and QA).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Design system architecture, deliver feature enhancements and bug fixes, and ensure overall code quality, performance, and application stability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Product Manager Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;: Collaborate with the PM on functional specifications, provide technical proposals, establish estimation baselines, and commit to deadlines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Deployment&lt;/strong&gt;: Create non-regression test scenarios, assess technical impacts (security, data flows, performance, scale), and ensure seamless production rollouts (pilot phases).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="25,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;AI &amp;amp; Innovative Tech Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Encourage and promote the daily use of Artificial Intelligence tools (specifically &lt;strong data-path-to-node="25,4,0" data-index-in-node="115"&gt;GitHub Copilot&lt;/strong&gt; with various models) to enhance productivity, code quality, and engineering innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,4,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,4,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Join the Tech Lead community to drive cross-team technical topics, maintain constant tech watch, challenge existing setups, and experiment with innovative solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="24"&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="25"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="25,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="25,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Android Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong proficiency in the Android framework and &lt;strong data-path-to-node="25,0,0" data-index-in-node="67"&gt;Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt;. Public contributions (GitHub) or solid professional experience.&lt;/p&gt;
